                Tambah Rekap Kesiswaan
              </h3>
            </div>
            <button
              type="button"
              class="btn-close-enrollment-modal text-muted hover:text-heading p-1.5 rounded-[6px] hover:bg-surface-subtle transition-colors cursor-pointer"
